  "upload": {
    "title": "Lexus Twisted an SUV Like a Pretzel 🥨 #shorts",
    "description": "This used to be a normal Lexus RX 450h+. 🥨\n\nFor MOTOMORPHOSIS in New York, the Brooklyn art collective MSCHF turned it into the \"Twisted Car\": the whole body spirals from nose to tail, built over steel armatures from thousands of individual pieces. Its sibling, an RZ 450e, was bent into a perfect loop called the \"Circle Car\". Neither one can be driven, and Lexus's own fine print says the modifications \"may void warranty\". 😅\n\nWould you park this in your driveway? 👇\n\nSubscribe to Top Techs for more mind-blowing tech in under a minute.",
